## ① Daily Targets

```
daily = NutritionCalculator.calculateTargets(profile)
// Returns: { cal: int, prot: int, carbs: int, fats: int }
// Example: { cal: 2000, prot: 120, carbs: 200, fats: 65 }
```

---

## ② Progressive DB Fetch

```
FUNCTION fetchCandidates(dailyCal, dietTypes):
  steps = [
    { lo: 0.10, hi: 0.45 },    // standard
    { lo: 0.07, hi: 0.55 },    // widen 40%
    { lo: 0.05, hi: 0.65 },    // widen further
    { lo: 0.00, hi: 1.00 },    // unrestricted
  ]
  FOR step IN steps:
    meals = supabase.from('meal_catalog').select()
      .inFilter('diet_type', dietTypes)
      .gte('calories', (dailyCal * step.lo).round())
      .lte('calories', (dailyCal * step.hi).round())

    grouped = groupByMealType(meals)                        // Step ③

    IF grouped.values.every((list) => list.length >= 2):
      RETURN grouped
  RETURN null    // triggers AI fallback
```

