## ④⑤ Initial Section Targets + Conservation

### Target Computation

```
CONSTANTS:
  baseWeight = { breakfast: 1.0, lunch: 1.2, snack: 0.4, dinner: 1.0 }
  goalAdjust(goal) =
    weight_loss: { breakfast: 0.0, lunch: 0.0, snack: -0.05, dinner: +0.15 }
    bulking:     { breakfast: +0.05, lunch: +0.15, snack: 0.0, dinner: 0.0 }
    maintain:    { breakfast: 0.0, lunch: 0.0, snack: 0.0, dinner: 0.0 }

FUNCTION computeInitialTargets(daily, goal):
  // Step A: Compute base shares (normalized)
  adjusted = { t: baseWeight[t] + goalAdjust(goal)[t]  FOR t IN allTypes }
  totalW = Σ adjusted[t]
  shares = { t: adjusted[t] / totalW  FOR t IN allTypes }
  // Guaranteed: Σ shares = 1.0

  // Step B: Distribute macros by share
  targets = {}
  FOR t IN allTypes:
    targets[t] = {
      cal:   daily.cal   × shares[t],
      prot:  daily.prot  × shares[t],
      carbs: daily.carbs × shares[t],
      fats:  daily.fats  × shares[t],
    }
  // At this point: Σ targets[t].prot == daily.prot (exact, by construction)

  // Step C: Goal timing shifts
  shiftApplied = {}
  IF goal == "weight_loss":
    shiftApplied["dinner.prot"] = targets["dinner"].prot × 0.15
    targets["dinner"].prot *= 1.15
  IF goal == "bulking":
    shiftApplied["lunch.carbs"] = targets["lunch"].carbs × 0.10
    targets["lunch"].carbs *= 1.10

  // Step D: Conservation redistribution (INV-5)
  FOR each shifted macro (e.g., prot):
    delta = shiftApplied amount            // e.g., dinner got +4.5g prot
    nonShifted = sections where this macro was NOT shifted
    totalNonShifted = Σ targets[j].prot FOR j IN nonShifted
    FOR j IN nonShifted:
      targets[j].prot -= delta × (targets[j].prot / totalNonShifted)

  // PROOF of conservation:
  //   Before shift: Σ prot = daily.prot (by construction)
  //   shift adds +delta to one section
  //   redistribution subtracts Σ(delta × share_j / Σshare_j) = delta × 1 = delta
  //   After: Σ prot = daily.prot + delta - delta = daily.prot ✓

  RETURN targets
```

### Numeric Example (weight_loss, daily.prot = 120g)

```
shares: breakfast=27.0%, lunch=32.4%, snack=9.5%, dinner=31.1%
initial prot: B=32.4, L=38.9, S=11.4, D=37.3  (Σ=120.0)

shift: D.prot *= 1.15 → D.prot = 42.9, delta = 5.6g
nonShifted: B(32.4), L(38.9), S(11.4)  totalNS = 82.7

redistribute:
  B.prot -= 5.6 × 32.4/82.7 = 5.6 × 0.392 = 2.2 → B.prot = 30.2
  L.prot -= 5.6 × 38.9/82.7 = 5.6 × 0.470 = 2.6 → L.prot = 36.3
  S.prot -= 5.6 × 11.4/82.7 = 5.6 × 0.138 = 0.8 → S.prot = 10.6

Final: B=30.2 + L=36.3 + S=10.6 + D=42.9 = 120.0 ✓
```

