## ⑨ Scoring: Asymmetric Unified Formula

```
FUNCTION computeDeviation(mealValue, targetValue, macro):
  denom = max(targetValue, 0.01)                  // INV-3: no div-by-zero
  raw = (mealValue - targetValue) / denom          // signed deviation

  // Asymmetric multipliers
  IF macro == "cal" AND raw > 0:    RETURN |raw| × 1.3    // calorie overshoot
  IF macro == "prot" AND raw < 0:   RETURN |raw| × 1.25   // protein undershoot
  IF macro == "fat" AND raw > 0:    RETURN |raw| × 1.1    // fat overshoot
  RETURN |raw|                                             // all others: symmetric

FUNCTION score(meal, sectionTarget, weights):
  error =
    weights.cal  × computeDeviation(meal.cal,  sectionTarget.cal,  "cal") +
    weights.prot × computeDeviation(meal.prot, sectionTarget.prot, "prot") +
    weights.carb × computeDeviation(meal.carb, sectionTarget.carb, "carb") +
    weights.fat  × computeDeviation(meal.fat,  sectionTarget.fat,  "fat")

  RETURN clamp(1.0 - error, 0.0, 1.0)              // INV-1: score ∈ [0,1]
```

