## ⑩ Goal-Aware Macro Skew Penalty

### Ideal Caloric Ratio Ranges Per Goal

```
goalIdealRanges(goal):
  weight_loss:
    protein: [0.25, 0.40]    // high protein priority
    carbs:   [0.25, 0.45]    // restricted carbs
    fats:    [0.20, 0.35]
  bulking:
    protein: [0.20, 0.35]
    carbs:   [0.40, 0.60]    // high carb tolerance
    fats:    [0.15, 0.30]    // lean bulk → restrict fat
  maintain:
    protein: [0.20, 0.35]
    carbs:   [0.35, 0.55]
    fats:    [0.20, 0.35]
```

### Penalty Formula

```
FUNCTION macroSkewPenalty(meal, goal):
  totalCal = max(meal.cal, 1)                           // INV-3
  protR = (meal.prot × 4) / totalCal
  carbR = (meal.carb × 4) / totalCal
  fatR  = (meal.fat  × 9) / totalCal

  ranges = goalIdealRanges(goal)

  // Overshoot/undershoot from ideal range
  protExcess = max(0, protR - ranges.prot.upper) + max(0, ranges.prot.lower - protR)
  carbExcess = max(0, carbR - ranges.carbs.upper) + max(0, ranges.carbs.lower - carbR)
  fatExcess  = max(0, fatR  - ranges.fats.upper)  + max(0, ranges.fats.lower  - fatR)

  rawPenalty = protExcess + carbExcess + fatExcess
  RETURN min(0.3, rawPenalty)                            // INV-7: capped
```

### Examples (weight_loss)

| Meal Ratios P/C/F | Over ideal? | rawPenalty | Final |
|-------------------|-------------|-----------|-------|
| 30%/40%/30% | All in range | 0.00 | 0.00 |
| 15%/60%/25% | P below 25% by 0.10, C above 45% by 0.15 | 0.25 | 0.25 |
| 10%/70%/20% | P below by 0.15, C above by 0.25 | 0.40 | 0.30 (capped) |
| 35%/35%/30% | All in range | 0.00 | 0.00 |

