## ⑪ Diversity

```
FUNCTION diversify(scoredMeals, userId, sectionIndex, yesterdayMealIds):
  // Layer 1: Yesterday penalty
  FOR m IN scoredMeals:
    IF m.id IN yesterdayMealIds:
      m.score ×= 0.85

  scoredMeals.sortDescending(by: score)

  // Layer 2: Dynamic pool = 60% of available (min 4)
  poolSize = max(4, ceil(scoredMeals.length × 0.6))
  pool = scoredMeals.take(min(poolSize, scoredMeals.length))

  // Layer 3: Deterministic shuffle
  seed = "$userId-${today()}-$sectionIndex".hashCode
  pool.shuffle(Random(seed))

  RETURN pool.take(min(4, pool.length))
```

