## Full Generation Pseudocode

```
FUNCTION generateMealOptions(profile, goal):
  // ①
  daily = NutritionCalculator.calculateTargets(profile)
  IF daily.cal <= 0: RETURN error("Complete your profile")

  // ②③
  dietTypes = profile.dietType == "nonveg" ? ["veg","nonveg"] : ["veg"]
  allCandidates = fetchCandidates(daily.cal, dietTypes)
  IF allCandidates == null: RETURN fallbackToGemini(profile)

  // ④⑤
  sectionTargets = computeInitialTargets(daily, goal)
  // INV-5 guaranteed by conservation redistribution

  // Load yesterday
  yesterdayIds = SharedPrefs.getStringList('yesterday_meals') ?? []

  sections = [breakfast, lunch, snack, dinner]
  options = {}
  deficits = { cal:1.0, prot:1.0, carb:1.0, fat:1.0 }

  FOR i, section IN enumerate(sections):
    target = sectionTargets[section]
    candidates = allCandidates[section]

    // ⑥
    weights = computeWeights(deficits, goal, completedSelections=0)

    // ⑦⑧
    (eligible, level) = getEligible(candidates, target, progress=0, goal)
    IF level == 3:
      options[section] = aiFallbackForSection(section, target)
      CONTINUE

    // ⑨⑩
    scored = eligible.map(m =>
      rawScore = score(m, target, weights)
      skew = macroSkewPenalty(m, goal)
      finalScore = rawScore × (1.0 - skew)          // INV-1: still ∈ [0,1]
      RETURN ScoredMeal(m, finalScore)
    )

    // ⑪
    options[section] = diversify(scored, profile.id, i, yesterdayIds)

  RETURN options
```

