## Full Re-Score Pseudocode

```
FUNCTION onUserSelect(sectionIndex, selectedMeal, state):
  state.selections[sections[sectionIndex]] = selectedMeal

  // INV-8: remaining is a computed getter
  consumed = Σ(sel.macros FOR sel IN state.selections.values WHERE sel != null)
  remaining = state.daily - consumed                // can go negative per macro
  completedSelections = count(non-null in state.selections)
  remainingSections = 4 - completedSelections

  IF remainingSections == 0: RETURN

  // ⑥ recompute
  deficits = computeDeficits(remaining, state.daily)
  weights = computeWeights(deficits, state.goal, completedSelections)
  progress = completedSelections / 3

  FOR j, section IN enumerate(sections):
    IF state.selections[section] != null: CONTINUE

    // ④ dynamic target (INV-4: clamped ≥ 0)
    sectionTarget = {
      cal:   max(0, remaining.cal   / remainingSections),
      prot:  max(0, remaining.prot  / remainingSections),
      carbs: max(0, remaining.carbs / remainingSections),
      fats:  max(0, remaining.fats  / remainingSections),
    }

    // ⑦⑧
    (eligible, level) = getEligible(state.allCandidates[section], sectionTarget, progress, state.goal)
    IF level == 3:
      state.options[section] = aiFallbackForSection(section, sectionTarget)
      CONTINUE

    // ⑨⑩⑪
    scored = eligible.map(m =>
      rawScore = score(m, sectionTarget, weights)
      skew = macroSkewPenalty(m, state.goal)
      RETURN ScoredMeal(m, rawScore × (1.0 - skew))
    )
    state.options[section] = diversify(scored, state.userId, j, state.yesterdayIds)
```

