## Formal Complexity

### Definitions

| Symbol | Meaning | Typical Value |
|--------|---------|---------------|
| n | Total meals fetched | 40-60 |
| s | Sections (constant) | 4 |
| k_i | Candidates for section i | 10-20 |
| k | max(k_i) | ≤ 25 |

### Analysis

```
Phase      Operation                     Time
───────────────────────────────────────────────────
Fetch      1 Supabase query              O(1) network
Group      Partition n meals by type      O(n)
───────────────────────────────────────────────────
Initial scoring (per section i):
  Rejection filter                        O(k_i)
  Score + skew computation                O(k_i)     // 10 ops per meal
  Sort                                    O(k_i log k_i)
  Diversity                               O(k_i)     // bounded by pool
  Section total                           O(k_i log k_i)

All sections:                             Σ O(k_i log k_i)

  By Jensen's inequality on convex f(x) = x log x:
  Σ k_i log k_i ≤ n log(n/s) + n  when  Σk_i = n
  Since s=4:  ≤ n log(n/4) + n ≤ n log n

Initial total:                            O(n) + O(n log n) = O(n log n)
───────────────────────────────────────────────────
Re-score (triggered ≤ 3 times):
  Weights recomputation                   O(1)
  Per unselected section                  O(k_j log k_j)
  Sections re-scored: ≤ 3
  Per trigger:                            O(Σ k_j log k_j) ≤ O(n log n)
  All triggers (≤3):                      O(3 × n log n) = O(n log n)
───────────────────────────────────────────────────
TOTAL:  O(n log n) + O(1) network

For n=60:  ~360 comparisons + ~720 arithmetic ops ≈ 1100 total
At 10⁹ ops/sec:  ≈ 1.1 μs CPU
Network:  ~100-200 ms (dominates)
```

### Space: [O(n)](file:///Users/adityamagar/Fitness-Geni/fitness_geni/lib/core/services/meal_service.dart#78-109) — ~60 meals × ~200 bytes + scored copies ≈ 50 KB

