    └── widgets/
        ├── catalog_meal_card.dart    [NEW]
        └── meal_card.dart           [KEEP]
```

---

## Edge Cases

| Scenario | Handling | Recovery Level |
|----------|----------|----------------|
| Section has 0 candidates after full filter | Starvation recovery: L1→L2→L3→AI | 0-3 |
| remaining goes negative on a macro | `abs()` in weights, `max(0)` in target, low-macro meals score best | — |
| Profile incomplete | Block generation, show bottom sheet | — |
| DB unreachable | Show error with retry button | — |
| User deselects previous choice | `remaining` recomputed via getter, all unselected re-scored | — |
| 1200 kcal user, narrow catalog | Progressive fetch widens in 4 steps | — |
| Same meals daily | 15% yesterday penalty + date-based seed rotation | — |
| Meal is 90% carbs (skewed) | Goal-aware skew penalty up to -30% score | — |
| sectionTarget.cal = 0 after overconsumption | Target clamps to 0; lightest meals score best; bounds use `max(0.01, target)` | — |

